WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.850
Since April 2022, couples in England and
Wales can divorce without anyone being

2
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.930
blamed.

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:11.840
The law needs one thing: the
marriage has broken down for good.

4
00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.580
But many couples made
their vows before God,

5
00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.700
not just before the law.

6
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:22.490
Asked about divorce, Jesus said humans
should not tear apart what God has joined.

7
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.050
So can a promise made till
death us do part ever be undone,

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.110
and who gets to decide?

9
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:33.100
In this mission, you'll read what Jesus
taught about marriage in the Gospels of

10
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.820
Mark and Matthew.

11
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:39.620
Then you'll compare how religious teachings
respond when a marriage breaks down.

12
00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:44.080
Your mission: find out whether a
lifelong promise can be undone,

13
00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.400
and who decides.
